-- Built-in proc catalogue: set procs, monster sets, mythics, stacking sets, synergies, class passives and
-- champion skills with their active time and cooldown. Adapted from the Cooldowns addon's data
-- (2.5.2, by g4rr3t, nogetrandom and B7TxSpeed), matched by ability IDs, not names, so it works in
-- every game language.
--
-- Fields: k = English name (key), t = kind, ids = ability IDs that start it, on = "combat" (default)
-- | "effect" (a buff on you: duration and stacks come from the buff) | "power" (a calculated value),
-- r = combat result (default "gained"), d = active seconds, cd = cooldown seconds (from the proc),
-- src = "onme" (it hits you), cdIds = IDs whose event carries the cooldown length (ms), endIds = IDs
-- that end the active part early, power/calc/scalar/start/cap/div = calculated value (see
-- DT.Procs.Calc), jorvuld = Jorvuld's Guidance lengthens it 40%, count = count procs, cp = champion
-- skill ID, icon, note, label = shown name when a set has two entries, hitDuration = active part from
-- the event's hit value (ms), name = the set's real name when the key differs, setIcon = the set's
-- own icon (head piece / weapon; from the ESO roster builder data), setIconGeneric = only a default
-- racial-style piece (crafted / overland sets). pscalar = the "missing" scalar of the Perfected version,
-- fmt = how the calculated value is written ("%d%%", "+%d"), info = IDs of the proc's buff: seconds left
-- on you + how many allies have it from you (shown on the icon), gate = it can only proc while a
-- resource is below a % (Martial Knowledge: stamina < 50%; "primary" = the bigger of magicka / stamina:
-- Pearls of Ehlnofey; the icon shows that resource as a gauge), waste = a proc that gives this resource is
-- wasted while it's full (Pearls at 100% ultimate: its counter turns red), dots = stacks are your
-- damage-over-time effects on your current target, up to this many (Touch of Z'en, like Cooldowns),
-- ultSpent = the buff lasts 1 s per this much Ultimate SPENT (Halls of Fabrication sets: 10) -- the cost of
-- the Ultimate you have slotted, not your Ultimate pool (Cooldowns' "pool % / 2.8" said 35.7 s at full);
-- buffIds = that buff on you: while it runs, its time left is the big number (the IDs are Cooldowns'
-- Cool.JorvuldIds in Main.lua -- the buffs Jorvuld's Guidance lengthens: MA 93120, WM 93442, Inventor's
-- Guard 93125, Automated Defense 93444 -- Cooldowns' catalogue IDs; LuiExtended lists 93120 and 93442 as Major
-- Slayer too) + 93109: the Major Slayer MA / WM put on the group, the ID HodorReflexes' ult module
-- (majorSlayerId, its "hasSlayer" = MA / WM wearers), BuffTheGroup and AlphaSquadUI track),
-- burst = count the proc's events in one go (Roaring Opportunist: one Major Slayer event per player it
-- buffs; the RoaringOpportunist addon counts them the same way), slayer = the Major Slayer duration your
-- stats give right now (Spell Damage / sd or max Magicka / mag seconds, at most cap; Jorvuld's x1.4). Gear entries are matched to your equipped sets by English name through
-- LibSets (optional dependency; without it gear procs aren't available).

